# The Seed Ark (CIPlay seed_ark): 30 m down; the drop, room 1's air and the manifest, the ice anglers, the timed gate
# and room 2, room 3 and the Ringwave file, room 4, the ark valve (the racks light, the closing note), the surface hole.
island The Seed Ark
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Ark
expect hidden closingnote
expect hidden racklights
zone drop
expect step 1
air room_1
expect step 2
read Ark manifest
expect step 3
open Room 1 seal box
kill Angler fish
expect step 4
use gatelever
expect hidden gate
air room_2
expect step 5
open Room 2 seal box
air room_3
expect step 6
read The Ringwave file
expect step 7
open Room 3 seal box
wait 3
expect story arkseal 3
air room_4
expect step 9
open Last rack locker
code rackpad 2240
expect story rackcode 1
open Last rack locker
# DEEP 10-24: the pumps first - the log, the rods from the halls, the islet's station, valves and tower
use arkvalve
expect story arkvalve 0
expect story arkseal 3
read Pump engineer's log
expect step 10
zone pump_islet
expect step 11
use sock1
expect story rodset 0
air hall_east
open East hall rod chest
air hall_west
open West hall rod chest
air hall_north
open North hall rod chest
wait 3
expect story coolrod 3
zone pump_islet
use sock1
use sock2
use sock3
expect story rodset 3
expect step 12
use pumplever
expect story pumpkey 1
expect step 13
expect hidden rats1
use valve1
expect shown rats1
use valve2
use valve3
expect story valveturned 3
expect step 14
zone pump_top
expect step 15
use pumpswitch
expect story pumpsrun 1
expect story pumpkey 0
expect step 16
air room_4
use arkvalve
expect story arkseal 0
expect story arkvalve 1
expect shown racklights
expect shown closingnote
expect step 17
read The closing note
expect step 18
zone surface_hole
expect done
# the extras: the pump keeper's chest, a suit cabinet, four treasures
open Pump keeper's chest
use suitbox1
dig 0
dig 1
dig 2
dig 3
